  (text "AC30/6 — Vox AC30/6-style, JMI drawing OS/065 (29-4-60, amended to Issue 4 of 11-9-64) · Circuit Codex · CC-BY-SA 4.0 · redrawn from circuit facts" (at 16 12 0)
